    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1330">

                <pb facs="1141" n="1037" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1037"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/530.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 20, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>An English syndicate has offered to arrange a large loan at once. American
                    bankers do not appreciate urgency of the situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Weitzel</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
